      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "工作人员好像也比预期中来得忙碌。\n如果他们因此不小心弄掉盘子或杯子，\n导致碎片四溅的话──",
      "source_fingerprint": "f646fe2faee3a48149630c662e150ca61de40de459421cb906b0cca4d9277110",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
