    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ea418b089e0984566f3297e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "某天，我在秋川理事长的命令之下，\n前往聚集了不少竞赛相关人士，\n甚至连名人都会在场的自助式派对。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6124f49f9b1cbc20ab37749a06fe276c4bbd4b6f53c07d55b5eafd9ad2b5421",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40bfa26e6f5cb77ad08d6034",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "总觉得自己显得好格格不入……！\n就在我紧张地不断四处张望时──",
      "source_fingerprint": "ab3f95070b40491ba6b0115411883b9d592484f5aec99332cca48fbdace0a864",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114001.json",
      "json_path": [
