      "uid": "zhcn:944b1c94739241d4bfeeb348",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "能听到各位的百般赞美，实在备感光荣。\n母亲跟祖母是我们家族的荣耀，\n更是我的目标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3009bc14edd978c505f1481854af00c25ec6fdf6a4a6a64dc361c786d28713a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
