    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00047235bfeccefefc9c1d99",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "嗯～太教人期待了！\n毕竟你母亲当初的表现，只能用\n青出于蓝而更胜于蓝来形容。",
      "source_fingerprint": "83174da931494c40f269c3ee81d8610c943499218e6d697ad992e689c871880d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114001.json",
      "json_path": [
