    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f723ad2c70608fd45b7e4c7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那么，红宝石小姐未来在赛场上的表现，\n想必会为华丽一族增添更多光彩才是！\n请容许我擅自期待你今后的活跃啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b7b6b438b63b621c2b638ec389818ab972b188cfe2dc126ee06c5ef8bdf4016",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
