      "uid": "zhcn:389e5eef7069f01c73e2d87c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一段时间过后。当我走出洗手间，\n准备从走廊回到会场时，\n偶遇正在讲电话的第一红宝石。",
      "source_fingerprint": "be6b371c9043e27d47a13de0a90413d575cd9c02c0beef5e5391b4f9bf689877",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
