      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63c3a9aa28e9a64496a62a13",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那个……你还好吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8a8c1dc063adca5d3f3de5c33e475124e65548f9e1311ea106020094379c24e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2facff19b45cdf47b21221c1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "想起她刚才仅仅是非常平静地\n应对他人带有强烈期望的言语。\n那面无表情的模样，令我莫名地在意。",
      "source_fingerprint": "341518f649cbb6f1b5f9539b989cc934fd4777879e9a56c4712a808d6cc6c57f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3bce9e78c7acbf17e3129a25",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我不是那个意思，是刚才……",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc3cf9fdd2cc389829439f24eb88149aedb16765c28abf9640af3771009136fe",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a1a264900a16d1d87d2dfaf8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一红宝石",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b56cd884b7441b8b32119740e379b8bc7aa840838b1c62bd9418c4a41cbf2b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8d7efaf6acddbe64451832ed",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……？\n怎么了吗？\n是不是我不小心失礼了？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7670bbe781aeda1da1b7e96bbdcf20ba13d2cde6736723b8627d52ce879be1d0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26c4168b1d392f5c082a5c4d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我支支吾吾地向她表达内心的疑问……\n问她会不会觉得他人的期待是种负担，\n或是感到很有压力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc2b302255e622ff94f4fb01f45a5d831858620393e4f6b4825d3d9bf91b3f7a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0af9f9f8088ddf498b7e13a4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一红宝石",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b56cd884b7441b8b32119740e379b8bc7aa840838b1c62bd9418c4a41cbf2b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76361154737c3836437ac2b4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……谢谢你的关心。不过，大家对我的期待\n就等于是对我们家族的期待。\n我没道理认为这是一种负担。",
      "source_fingerprint": "01c53746c7174080678cd0010e117d101574c6d393e91ca8f00f2f791ce883db",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        23,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/23/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6963c10bbc4143b482e0fb65",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "其实我正愁不知道该向哪些人打招呼……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f91dee4fad5adf078f0e364d323bcfb2cd4d2d13501db8afa66d4760f286a728",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        24,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/24/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4a408cf0dbd72ec070167367",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一红宝石",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b56cd884b7441b8b32119740e379b8bc7aa840838b1c62bd9418c4a41cbf2b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114001.json",
      "json_path": [
