    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5989f70e3b443b6393e8f776",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "原来如此。那么──",
      "source_fingerprint": "3846999ddf83690c12e55b603f18270760c14e8b31115235df2bb5d73d17891b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:43c50da58a1fb9285fcd31ec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "谢、谢谢你！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a3492863d867dab1085d5d49717b13fb32fc21a8d7532207651a70b48af0811a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60009393aa7f2802b0440bdd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一红宝石告诉了我该向谁打招呼。\n她比我这个成年人\n还要熟悉业界人脉……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "543daaf34ad31d0c800549b633e32dd5e9ca7e64f1142d654c138ae95b1a9521",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce22cfca67cc277a1830ae0a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一红宝石",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b56cd884b7441b8b32119740e379b8bc7aa840838b1c62bd9418c4a41cbf2b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9bb39b907232907f69192aa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不客气。那么，我先失陪了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "810fe03862ba16e63e3f3f650e890ae189883ae9064bc778e0d97041fa52eca6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:abbe3d30448cbf5b34e4533a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一红宝石踩着不带任何迟疑的脚步回到会场。\n她的身姿非常挺直，却相当娇小──",
      "source_fingerprint": "992a8d0545d437c1bdf118ecdf1d42cf8e59b294bd92fb7de4b1c865f1a3656d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27cb9429fb3c7bef2fe03e0e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我总觉得她承受的莫大期待，\n对她纤细的身躯来说，实在太过沉重。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2dfebb892810c0fac66cf77d8d50182f5348d6701929eab0e746fd3751407eb5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114001.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        29,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/29/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07fc6fdf808471498f83c592",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "第一红宝石",
      "source_fingerprint": "9b56cd884b7441b8b32119740e379b8bc7aa840838b1c62bd9418c4a41cbf2b4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/83/0114/storytimeline_830114001.json",
